    "created_at": "2023-04-14T15:58:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-14T15:58:59Z",
    "body": "> The previously focused element should be restored only when focus is currently in the popover.\r\n\r\nI suppose this is to allow you to set the focus to something while the popover is open? I think there was another issue in this repository about doing that, but I don't remember if it came to a conclusion.",
